      "title": "Actual compact Gaussian observer and homogeneous entropy limits",
      "source": {
        "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06906v1#S4.E6",
        "edition": "SPHMC arXiv2609.06906v1; omitted background expanded against pinned SLT d0f506f0 and Mathlib db584cd6; Lean4.33.0",
        "anchor": "FIRST S4.E6 GaussianLSI background; SLT GaussianPoincare/Limit.lean compact observer and entropy convergence, including L1213-L1234 actual law-to-entropy use; authored literal Bool-count and rootBCF adapter",
        "wording_status": "faithful paraphrase",
        "attribution": "Actual compact scalar specialization authored for the omitted GaussianLSI background. Pinned SLT is external source reference, not an imported proof certificate; all called proof APIs are ASTIS/Mathlib. Independent exact StatementSeal before proof. No full GaussianLSI or printed SPHMC inequality claimed."
      },
      "statement": "For every real C2 function f with compact support, the actual variance-one centered Gaussian integrates f squared, f squared times log(f squared), and the square of its real derivative. Each actual normalized Bool counting measure integrates those same functions of the signed sum divided by sqrt(N), including N=0. Their positive-index (N+1) count integrals converge respectively to the Gaussian integrals. The corresponding homogeneous entropy, including zero mass, converges to the Gaussian homogeneous entropy. All domains and limits are produced internally.",
      "assumptions": [
        "f:Real->Real, ContDiff Real 2 f, HasCompactSupport f: exact C2 AND compact support; no normalization or positive mass.",
        "Canonical real Borel Gaussian of mean0 varianceNNReal1 and canonical finite Boolean carrier. The literal normalized count law and signsum map are fixed; all L1 and limits are outputs.",
        "Real.log0=0 and tlogt is continuous at0. All N finite L1 includes0; only successor sequences assert asymptotic limits. AtN0 derivative observer equals fprime(0)^2 and need not vanish.",
        "Authored compact scalar background integration, not printed SPHMC FIRST4.6. Fullflip-energy4, GaussianLSI, finite-Hilbert/noncompact extension, T2, main and expected costs remain open."
      ],
      "formulae": [
        {
          "label": "Actual compact Gaussian observer and homogeneous entropy limits",
          "tex": "\\mu_N=2^{-N}\\sum_{\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}^N}\\delta_\\varepsilon,\\quad S_N=N^{-1/2}\\sum_j\\sigma(\\varepsilon_j),\\quad\\gamma=\\mathcal N(0,1);\\quad\\int A(S_{N+1})\\,d\\mu_{N+1}\\to\\int A\\,d\\gamma\\quad(A=f^2,\\ f^2\\log f^2,\\ (f\\prime)^2),\\quad\\operatorname{Ent}_{\\mu_{N+1}}(f^2\\circ S_{N+1})\\to\\operatorname{Ent}_{\\gamma}(f^2)."
        }
      ],
